<title>BRAZIL: Sao Paulo March unemployment 15 pct -- Dieese.</title>
<headline>Sao Paulo March unemployment 15 pct -- Dieese.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The unemployment rate in Sao Paulo city was steady at 15 percent in March, the same rate as in March 1996, the Labor Union Statistics Institute (Dieese) reported.</p>
<p>The number of unemployed workers was up to 1.263 million from 1.238 million a year earlier, it said.</p>
<p>In February the number of unemployed workers was 14.2 percent of the city work force, or 1.192 million, it said.</p>
<p>((--Alexandre Caverni, Sao Paulo Newsroom, 55 11 2485418))</p>
